1
00:02:31,110 --> 00:02:36,110
This is the time known as the Great Pirate Era.

2
00:02:36,110 --> 00:02:39,110
A countless array of pirates go to battle across the seas

3
00:02:39,110 --> 00:02:41,110
in search of the One Piece,

4
00:02:41,110 --> 00:02:44,110
the legendary treasure left behind by Gold Roger,

5
00:02:44,110 --> 00:02:45,110
King of the Pirates.

6
00:02:45,110 --> 00:02:48,110
Munkini Luffy, a boy whose body turned to rubber

7
00:02:48,110 --> 00:02:50,110
after eating the gum gum fruit,

8
00:02:50,110 --> 00:02:53,110
set sail to become the next King of the Pirates.

9
00:02:53,110 --> 00:02:56,110
As Luffy and his crew conquer numerous obstacles,

10
00:02:56,110 --> 00:02:59,110
they capture the unwanted attention of the world government,

11
00:02:59,110 --> 00:03:02,110
which will use any means necessary to stop them.

12
00:03:02,110 --> 00:03:05,110
Now this exciting!

13
00:03:05,110 --> 00:03:08,110
Can't wait to see what kind of adventure's up next!

14
00:03:08,110 --> 00:03:12,110
With a charted course awash in danger and intrigue,

15
00:03:12,110 --> 00:03:17,110
the crew will cut a path across the Grand Line to the New World.

16
00:03:21,110 --> 00:03:23,110
Separated from the rest of his crew,

17
00:03:23,110 --> 00:03:25,110
Luffy struggled in vain to rescue his brother Ace

18
00:03:25,110 --> 00:03:27,110
from execution at the hands of the Navy.

19
00:03:27,110 --> 00:03:30,110
Marineford was then thrown into chaos by Blackbeard,

20
00:03:30,110 --> 00:03:33,110
who stole Whitebeard's devil fruit power.

21
00:03:33,110 --> 00:03:35,110
Traumatized by the death of his brother,

22
00:03:35,110 --> 00:03:37,110
Luffy is carried away by Jinbei,

23
00:03:37,110 --> 00:03:41,110
who fights to escape the island alongside Whitebeard's surviving crew.

24
00:03:42,110 --> 00:03:45,110
How about I give Marineford a burial at sea?

25
00:03:45,110 --> 00:04:00,110
You can tear down our buildings, but in time we will rebuild them.

26
00:04:00,110 --> 00:04:02,110
But this island is different.

27
00:04:02,110 --> 00:04:04,110
It's more than a symbol of our strength.

28
00:04:04,110 --> 00:04:07,110
It stands in the center of the world.

29
00:04:07,110 --> 00:04:12,110
And that means if we want to protect innocent people from criminals such as yourself,

30
00:04:12,110 --> 00:04:14,110
it must be our stronghold,

31
00:04:14,110 --> 00:04:17,110
so its light can reach every corner.

32
00:04:17,110 --> 00:04:25,110
It doesn't perish, and it will certainly not sink by your hand.

33
00:04:25,110 --> 00:04:27,110
Turn to learn your place.

34
00:04:27,110 --> 00:04:29,110
Well, come on!

35
00:04:29,110 --> 00:04:33,110
Let's see what you're made of!

36
00:04:33,110 --> 00:04:39,110
Destroy them! Destroy them! Destroy them! Destroy them! Destroy them! Destroy them!

37
00:04:39,110 --> 00:04:41,110
Destroy them! Destroy them!

38
00:04:41,110 --> 00:04:44,110
What are these voices in my head?

39
00:04:44,110 --> 00:04:48,110
I dare not base him on dry land, but the sea will aid me!

40
00:04:55,110 --> 00:04:57,110
The water! It's frozen solid!

41
00:04:57,110 --> 00:04:59,110
Amos!

42
00:05:03,110 --> 00:05:06,110
I say, if you're gonna protect someone, then do it right!

43
00:05:06,110 --> 00:05:10,110
I don't like either of you, but if you screw this up, then you'll let the Navy win!

44
00:05:16,110 --> 00:05:17,110
What is that?

45
00:05:17,110 --> 00:05:18,110
It was underwater!

46
00:05:18,110 --> 00:05:19,110
A ship?

47
00:05:19,110 --> 00:05:21,110
It's a submarine!

48
00:05:21,110 --> 00:05:23,110
That's a Jolly Roger!

49
00:05:25,110 --> 00:05:27,110
Quick! Hand over Straw Hat!

50
00:05:27,110 --> 00:05:30,110
Huh? I don't take orders from you, pal!

51
00:05:30,110 --> 00:05:33,110
And besides, what do you want with him anyway, you weirdo?

52
00:05:33,110 --> 00:05:36,110
That's me! Who the hell are you?

53
00:05:36,110 --> 00:05:38,110
Hand him over and we can escape!

54
00:05:38,110 --> 00:05:40,110
He'll die without my help!

55
00:05:40,110 --> 00:05:41,110
What?

56
00:05:46,110 --> 00:05:48,110
Trust me. I'm a doctor.

57
00:05:52,110 --> 00:05:56,110
The Desperate Scream! Courageous moments that will change the future!

58
00:05:56,110 --> 00:06:02,110
Oh, doctor my ass! What kind of doctor carries a giant sword?

59
00:06:02,110 --> 00:06:05,110
And the whole submarine thing is fishy too! What's your deal?

60
00:06:05,110 --> 00:06:07,110
Who is it? Another pirate crew?

61
00:06:07,110 --> 00:06:11,110
It's Trafalgar Law, sir. He's a rookie from the North Blue.

62
00:06:11,110 --> 00:06:13,110
Then he must be Straw Hat's accomplice.

63
00:06:13,110 --> 00:06:17,110
The two started trouble with the Celestial Dragons on Sabahodian while back,

64
00:06:17,110 --> 00:06:21,110
but we weren't able to capture either of them. He's quite dangerous.

65
00:06:22,110 --> 00:06:25,110
They must be planning to escape by submarine!

66
00:06:25,110 --> 00:06:27,110
Stop screwing around! Hand him over!

67
00:06:27,110 --> 00:06:30,110
What's in it for me? What's in it for you?

68
00:06:38,110 --> 00:06:40,110
Captain Law! Navy battleships are approaching from the stern!

69
00:06:40,110 --> 00:06:47,110
Damn it! There's no time! We gotta escape now!

70
00:06:51,110 --> 00:06:53,110
Even if he does survive today,

71
00:06:53,110 --> 00:06:56,110
what makes you think Straw Hat will do you any favors?

72
00:06:56,110 --> 00:06:59,110
He's the son of the most heinous criminal in the world.

73
00:06:59,110 --> 00:07:03,110
He could be your undoing just as easily as he could be your ally.

74
00:07:03,110 --> 00:07:06,110
If you're so determined to stand in the path of justice,

75
00:07:06,110 --> 00:07:09,110
I will grind you beneath its wheels.

76
00:07:10,110 --> 00:07:13,110
Let's finish this and bleed!

77
00:07:13,110 --> 00:07:15,110
Don't let him gain another inch!

78
00:07:19,110 --> 00:07:20,110
That's enough!

79
00:07:20,110 --> 00:07:23,110
You're not laying another finger on Straw Hat or anyone else!

80
00:07:24,110 --> 00:07:26,110
Prepare for combat!

81
00:07:26,110 --> 00:07:28,110
Team A will pursue the Whitebeard pirates

82
00:07:28,110 --> 00:07:32,110
and Team B will stop Blackbeard and his crew at any cause.

83
00:07:32,110 --> 00:07:41,110
The reinforcements are coming from underground!

84
00:07:42,110 --> 00:07:43,110
Do they ever stop?

85
00:07:45,110 --> 00:07:46,110
Finally!

86
00:07:46,110 --> 00:07:48,110
Now let's rush them down!

87
00:07:48,110 --> 00:08:03,110
Hey, pal! You're acting kinda weird!

88
00:08:03,110 --> 00:08:04,110
Snap out of it!

89
00:08:04,110 --> 00:08:06,110
Come on! Let's go!

90
00:08:18,110 --> 00:08:22,110
No, no!

91
00:08:30,110 --> 00:08:33,110
No, no!

92
00:08:37,110 --> 00:08:41,110
So the leader of the Navy can still slow me down a bit.

93
00:08:41,110 --> 00:08:43,110
Nobody's perfect even with my power.

94
00:08:43,110 --> 00:08:45,310
can still slow me down a bit.

95
00:08:45,310 --> 00:08:48,610
Nobody's perfect even with my power.

96
00:08:48,610 --> 00:08:50,810
Still, that's not enough.

97
00:08:50,810 --> 00:08:52,390
I'm sinking this dump.

98
00:08:52,390 --> 00:08:53,730
Watch me.

99
00:08:53,730 --> 00:08:56,130
You'll do no such thing.

100
00:08:56,130 --> 00:08:58,790
I'll strike you from this island and from this world.

101
00:09:07,210 --> 00:09:08,970
He stopped the shockwave.

102
00:09:08,970 --> 00:09:11,570
Even the fleet admiral can't faze him.

103
00:09:11,570 --> 00:09:14,570
Hey, Cap, save some for me!

104
00:09:14,570 --> 00:09:16,370
Wee-ha-ha-ha!

105
00:09:29,330 --> 00:09:30,830
What? Hit me!

106
00:09:33,750 --> 00:09:34,590
Gar!

107
00:09:36,730 --> 00:09:39,830
I'm a marine, same as you.

108
00:09:39,830 --> 00:09:42,630
And I've spent enough time feeling sorry for myself.

109
00:09:43,630 --> 00:09:44,630
Ha!

110
00:09:44,630 --> 00:09:45,630
Sorry, Grants!

111
00:09:45,630 --> 00:09:46,830
You're finished!

112
00:09:47,830 --> 00:09:50,210
This is the face of a new era!

113
00:10:02,210 --> 00:10:02,830
Captain!

114
00:10:02,830 --> 00:10:04,830
We're almost within their firing range!

115
00:10:04,830 --> 00:10:06,830
Of course it is, Beppo!

116
00:10:06,830 --> 00:10:07,830
Do something!

117
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:08,830
Come on!

118
00:10:08,830 --> 00:10:10,830
You just joined the crew and you're already ordering me around?

119
00:10:13,830 --> 00:10:15,830
They've got us surrounded!

120
00:10:15,830 --> 00:10:17,830
All cannons, fire at once!

121
00:10:17,830 --> 00:10:18,830
Sink them!

122
00:10:18,830 --> 00:10:19,830
Fire!

123
00:10:19,830 --> 00:10:20,830
Fire!

124
00:10:20,830 --> 00:10:22,830
Fire!

125
00:10:22,830 --> 00:10:23,830
Fire!

126
00:10:26,130 --> 00:10:26,830
Fire!

127
00:10:26,830 --> 00:10:27,830
Fire!

128
00:10:27,830 --> 00:10:41,830
Fire!

129
00:10:41,830 --> 00:10:42,830
Oh, wait!

130
00:10:42,830 --> 00:10:44,830
You know what?

131
00:10:45,710 --> 00:10:52,170
Not again. Must be Blackbeard doing this. I thought we were done with these earthquakes. This power is a real pain.

132
00:10:52,170 --> 00:10:57,950
Is it just me or is this way stronger than the last time? Watch out, men. This is bad.

133
00:11:06,750 --> 00:11:11,790
This is all wrong. Look at the clouds. Look at this sea. He's staring everything apart.

134
00:11:12,830 --> 00:11:17,050
Come on.

135
00:11:37,850 --> 00:11:40,850
You gotta admit, it's pretty fun to watch.

136
00:11:43,830 --> 00:11:46,830
You didn't forget about me, did you, Cloud?

137
00:11:48,830 --> 00:11:49,830
You forget about us?

138
00:11:54,830 --> 00:11:55,830
What was it?

139
00:11:56,830 --> 00:12:00,830
Block the Marines! Even if we die, our friends can escape!

140
00:12:01,830 --> 00:12:04,830
Don't make me laugh! We're hunting down every last one of you!

141
00:12:04,830 --> 00:12:12,830
Maroon! Another fabulous show, though a bit close for comfort this time.

142
00:12:13,830 --> 00:12:16,830
Yeah, power's not an issue, but control is tricky.

143
00:12:17,830 --> 00:12:22,830
Ha! You're not kidding! If you're gonna sink this place, at least wait till we're not standing on it!

144
00:12:22,830 --> 00:12:24,830
Stop this! It's madness!

145
00:12:24,830 --> 00:12:27,830
Not enough that you killed Whitebeard and Coldblood.

146
00:12:27,830 --> 00:12:32,830
Now you're abusing his power and putting his own crew members at risk with this nonsense!

147
00:12:32,830 --> 00:12:37,830
What? Are you trying to nag me to death? If you got a problem, then do something about it!

148
00:12:38,830 --> 00:12:42,830
I don't play nice! Those days are as dead and gone as Whitebeard!

149
00:12:55,830 --> 00:12:58,830
No one should have that much power! They can't stop him!

150
00:12:58,830 --> 00:12:59,830
It's a nightmare!

151
00:12:59,830 --> 00:13:00,830
No one's safe!

152
00:13:00,830 --> 00:13:04,830
This is a warning from the Saba-Odi Archipelago Emergency Broadcast System.

153
00:13:04,830 --> 00:13:09,830
Following an earthquake at Marineford, a tsunami is expected to hit our southern shores.

154
00:13:10,830 --> 00:13:14,830
Everyone please remain calm and listen carefully for the following safety instructions.

155
00:13:19,830 --> 00:13:20,830
Run for it!

156
00:13:20,830 --> 00:13:21,830
Move it! What are you doing?!

157
00:13:21,830 --> 00:13:30,830
I'm a nobleman! I'll pay good money if you let me go ahead!

158
00:13:30,830 --> 00:13:36,830
Please proceed in an orderly fashion.

159
00:14:00,830 --> 00:14:03,830
Those weird robots are crawling over the crack in the plaza!

160
00:14:06,830 --> 00:14:10,830
Come on! Move! Follow the pacifistas and open fire!

161
00:14:10,830 --> 00:14:11,830
Hey, you okay?

162
00:14:11,830 --> 00:14:17,830
I got this, guys. You two going ahead without me. Are you nuts?!

163
00:14:17,830 --> 00:14:23,830
Look, we have our orders. This makes sense. Better you escape, then all four of us get killed here!

164
00:14:23,830 --> 00:14:25,830
Okay, I guess you're right!

165
00:14:25,830 --> 00:14:26,830
Good luck!

166
00:14:26,830 --> 00:14:28,830
Come on! Stay with me!

167
00:14:29,830 --> 00:14:32,830
What a joke! You're all just marching to your damn graves!

168
00:14:32,830 --> 00:14:39,830
Pops, I'm sorry, but for the first time, I can't follow your orders! I'm gonna fight these guys to the death!

169
00:14:40,830 --> 00:14:43,830
I'm with you. Looks like we'll be joining Pops in Heaven soon enough!

170
00:14:45,830 --> 00:14:48,830
Finally, it stopped shaking.

171
00:14:53,830 --> 00:14:55,830
What the heck is going on with you?

172
00:14:56,830 --> 00:14:59,830
I don't know. There's too much sadness.

173
00:15:00,830 --> 00:15:01,830
What does that mean?

174
00:15:02,830 --> 00:15:17,830
There are all these voices in my head, but I can feel them disappearing one by one.

175
00:15:23,830 --> 00:15:25,830
Huh? Voices?

176
00:15:26,830 --> 00:15:28,830
We'll show you the meaning of justice!

177
00:15:28,830 --> 00:15:30,830
Justice? This is murder!

178
00:15:30,830 --> 00:15:33,830
Hold them off! Let the others escape!

179
00:15:33,830 --> 00:15:36,830
They're criminals! Shoot the bastards in their backs if you have to!

180
00:15:36,830 --> 00:15:51,830
There! That's for my friend, you damn murderer!

181
00:15:51,830 --> 00:15:54,830
You're gonna pay for your crimes and blood, scumback!

182
00:15:56,830 --> 00:16:03,830
We're sending a message, you hear me? We rule this world! Order rules this world!

183
00:16:04,830 --> 00:16:05,830
Got one!

184
00:16:05,830 --> 00:16:10,830
Okay, I know we're all stressed out right now, but you're losing your mind here! Pull it together!

185
00:16:11,830 --> 00:16:12,830
Please, somebody help!

186
00:16:12,830 --> 00:16:14,830
I can't make it! I can't make it!

187
00:16:14,830 --> 00:16:15,830
Ah!

188
00:16:15,830 --> 00:16:16,830
I can't make it!

189
00:16:16,830 --> 00:16:17,830
I can't make it!

190
00:16:17,830 --> 00:16:18,830
I can't make it!

191
00:16:19,830 --> 00:16:20,830
I can't make it!

192
00:16:21,830 --> 00:16:22,830
Kobe!

193
00:16:23,830 --> 00:16:25,830
Hey, wait! Don't run from me!

194
00:16:27,830 --> 00:16:29,830
We're not losing anymore, okay? Now stay back!

195
00:16:30,830 --> 00:16:33,830
We'll save you! You'll be fine! Hear me?

196
00:16:33,830 --> 00:16:35,830
Please, I'm scared.

197
00:16:35,830 --> 00:16:38,830
Leave him. We're not done fighting, dammit.

198
00:16:38,830 --> 00:16:39,830
But, sir...

199
00:16:39,830 --> 00:16:41,830
The pirates are escaping.

200
00:16:41,830 --> 00:16:43,830
Our job is to enforce justice.

201
00:16:43,830 --> 00:16:46,830
We don't have time to tend to the wounded. Go!

202
00:16:46,830 --> 00:16:48,830
Yes, sir.

203
00:16:49,830 --> 00:16:51,830
Kill every last one of them!

204
00:16:51,830 --> 00:16:54,830
Show the world what happens when you defy us!

205
00:16:56,830 --> 00:16:59,830
We've got a man down! Medic!

206
00:16:59,830 --> 00:17:04,830
They're all running away! Just shoot one and move on!

207
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:06,830
It's not about winning anymore.

208
00:17:06,830 --> 00:17:09,830
They're bloodthirsty. They want revenge!

209
00:17:14,830 --> 00:17:16,830
It went straight through him!

210
00:17:16,830 --> 00:17:17,830
Run!

211
00:17:17,830 --> 00:17:18,830
Chase them down!

212
00:17:18,830 --> 00:17:20,830
Edwin, liar!

213
00:17:21,830 --> 00:17:25,830
Even if our enemies are criminals, this isn't justice.

214
00:17:25,830 --> 00:17:28,830
Their wrongs don't make us right.

215
00:17:29,830 --> 00:17:32,830
They understand.

216
00:17:35,830 --> 00:17:38,830
How's it called?

217
00:17:38,830 --> 00:17:40,830
Noooo!

218
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:42,830
Noooo!

219
00:17:46,830 --> 00:17:48,830
I...

220
00:17:48,830 --> 00:17:51,830
Nope...

221
00:17:51,830 --> 00:18:01,990
If you're a marine, then follow my lead and strike them down with no mercy!

222
00:18:02,410 --> 00:18:02,950
Kurio!

223
00:18:03,590 --> 00:18:05,910
Yeah! Sakazuki!

224
00:18:05,910 --> 00:18:06,910
Yeah!

225
00:18:21,830 --> 00:18:28,510
Hey, are you alright? Damn it! Get up!

226
00:18:51,830 --> 00:19:10,070
Ha ha ha ha ha! Funny, I don't see anyone stopping me! Or even trying! Are you Navy boys...scared?

227
00:19:10,070 --> 00:19:17,270
Yikes! He's nuts! He's fighting Sengoku now! But I have a feeling, if he gets bored, we'll be next!

228
00:19:21,830 --> 00:19:29,750
Excuse me, friend, but why don't you come on down here?

229
00:19:29,750 --> 00:19:31,990
No, not you!

230
00:19:31,990 --> 00:19:32,950
Kizaru!

231
00:19:32,950 --> 00:19:34,790
Drop them now, you idiot!

232
00:19:34,790 --> 00:19:40,950
You know what, Vaughn? I don't need this right now! I've done enough! They're probably gonna die anyway!

233
00:19:40,950 --> 00:19:43,110
John Vaughn, here they come!

234
00:19:43,110 --> 00:19:45,750
Ooh, nice catch!

235
00:19:45,750 --> 00:19:47,590
Alright, now submerge!

236
00:19:47,590 --> 00:19:50,950
Don't think I forgot about what happened on Saba Odi.

237
00:19:50,950 --> 00:19:53,110
Time to pay!

238
00:19:53,110 --> 00:19:56,710
Whoa! These wounds are pretty bad! Hang in there!

239
00:20:00,390 --> 00:20:03,190
Tam, time to die!

240
00:20:03,190 --> 00:20:06,070
You've done enough!

241
00:20:11,990 --> 00:20:12,710
A marine?

242
00:20:20,950 --> 00:20:21,670
Kobi!

243
00:20:21,670 --> 00:20:33,110
There's no point in fighting anymore! There's no point in killing! It's over! We won! We can end this!

244
00:20:33,110 --> 00:20:34,390
What is he doing?

245
00:20:34,390 --> 00:20:35,110
I can't move!

246
00:20:35,110 --> 00:20:36,790
I can't move!

247
00:20:36,790 --> 00:20:40,790
Please, someone help!

248
00:20:40,790 --> 00:20:44,950
These are human lives! This is wrong!

249
00:20:44,950 --> 00:20:49,510
They have families, children! They're our friends, and we're watching them die!

250
00:20:49,510 --> 00:21:10,550
We killed Ace! Whitebeard is dead! The pirates don't have the will to fight anymore! What are we trying to prove? What's the point? There are wounded men out there! We can save them if we stop fighting! But no, we're just making more victims, more casualties! Those marines have nothing to be proud of!

251
00:21:10,550 --> 00:21:12,710
That's Kobi!

252
00:21:12,710 --> 00:21:16,710
Why are they dying? What are they even fighting for?

253
00:21:16,710 --> 00:21:20,710
Boy, you better run.

254
00:21:20,710 --> 00:21:26,710
You're wasting my time!

255
00:21:26,710 --> 00:21:30,710
Time! If you would impede justice, I have no use for you!

256
00:21:32,630 --> 00:21:36,870
This is it? Not exactly what I'd hoped for, but at least I said what I had to say!

257
00:21:39,110 --> 00:21:40,870
I have no regrets!

258
00:21:42,870 --> 00:21:44,870
Kobi!

259
00:21:56,710 --> 00:22:13,910
A splendid speech touched my heart. And though they were few, those precious moments of courage you showed will change this world. Though only the future will tell if it's for the better, or for the worse.

260
00:22:13,910 --> 00:22:15,910
Inside! I'll be right behind you!

261
00:22:15,910 --> 00:22:16,630
Roger!

262
00:22:16,630 --> 00:22:18,630
I don't think so.

263
00:22:18,630 --> 00:22:24,550
Put your hands up! Now!

264
00:22:25,430 --> 00:22:28,310
Ooh, I'll be Ben Beckman!

265
00:22:29,830 --> 00:22:32,870
Hey, wait a second! I know that ship!

266
00:22:32,870 --> 00:22:33,430
Let's move!

267
00:22:34,390 --> 00:22:38,310
What's he doing here? One of the Four Emperors and his crew!

268
00:22:39,110 --> 00:22:41,430
It's Red-Head Shanks O'Boo!

269
00:22:48,630 --> 00:22:56,870
It's been a long time, old friend.

270
00:23:01,110 --> 00:23:02,390
Let's end this war.

271
00:23:02,390 --> 00:23:19,110
Suddenly, the Red-Hair Pirates appear. As the Navy stares on in shock, Roar tries to escape while suffering heavy fire from the Admirals.

272
00:23:19,110 --> 00:23:25,350
Narrowly missing a reunion with Luffy, Shanks utters a speech on the battlefield that brings the fighting to a halt.

273
00:23:25,350 --> 00:23:33,350
On the next, One Piece, here comes Shanks! The War of the Best is finally over! I'm gonna be King of the Pirates!

